WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:02.250
You asked your AI for a feature.

00:00:02.250 --> 00:00:04.620
It wrote twelve files in thirty seconds.

00:00:04.920 --> 00:00:06.640
Do you know what it actually built?

00:00:07.540 --> 00:00:08.850
Vibe coding is fast.

00:00:08.850 --> 00:00:10.490
Reading every diff isn't.

00:00:10.790 --> 00:00:13.730
And when something breaks, you're lost in code you didn't write.

00:00:14.630 --> 00:00:18.170
Meet Codeville, a desktop workspace built for vibe coders.

00:00:18.470 --> 00:00:21.230
It turns your project into a town you can see:

00:00:21.230 --> 00:00:23.940
every feature a district, every file a block.

00:00:24.840 --> 00:00:29.740
Open any project, and it shows you the stack, the features, and how everything connects.

00:00:30.640 --> 00:00:34.480
Prompt Claude Code, and watch every file land in the town, live.

00:00:34.780 --> 00:00:36.360
You always know what changed.

00:00:37.260 --> 00:00:42.420
When tests fail, a shopper walks your tests and stops at the one that broke, with the fix to make.

00:00:43.320 --> 00:00:43.650
Ready?

00:00:43.650 --> 00:00:45.310
Commit and push, in one click.

00:00:47.120 --> 00:00:50.980
And when you want to show it off, steer your code as a hologram, with your hands.

00:00:51.880 --> 00:00:52.460
Codeville.

00:00:52.460 --> 00:00:53.850
See what your AI builds.

00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:55.560
Download it for Windows.
